                "richtext_H9znm6": {
                    "type": "richtext",
                    "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Our team is obsessed with the art of performance. With <strong>over 10 years<\/strong> of dive-in Social Ads, we have an outperforming Media Buying team with more than <strong>200 experts.<\/strong><br\/><br\/>We know how to craft content that resonates with audiences and drives conversions. On average, we’re <strong>60%<\/strong> faster at finding the right ad model for your products<br\/><br\/>ensuring every dollar spent drives maximum ROI.<\/p>",
